note as IMMUTABILITY_diagram_10_audit
  Audit and history records are append-only. Runtime roles cannot UPDATE or
  DELETE them. Corrections are new records linked to the prior evidence.
end note

note as POLYMORPHIC_diagram_10_audit
  Generic target references are validated through system_ops.entity_registry
  and never accepted directly from untrusted client input.
end note


note as HISTORY_CONTRACT_diagram_10_audit
  UNIFORM HISTORY CONTRACT
  Each history table uses a singular source FK, revision_no, valid_from/valid_to,
  data_snapshot and recorded_at. The physical model must enforce UNIQUE(source_id,
  revision_no), valid_to > valid_from when present, and append-only permissions.
end note

