note as HASH_CHAIN_diagram_10b_audit_health_extensions
  TAMPER EVIDENCE
  Production physical design should hash-chain or externally seal audit
  batches, replicate them to immutable storage and enforce separate write
  credentials. Audit evidence must not be editable by application admins.
end note

note as HISTORY_CONTRACT_diagram_10b_audit_health_extensions
  UNIFORM HISTORY CONTRACT
  Each history table uses a singular source FK, revision_no, valid_from/valid_to,
  data_snapshot and recorded_at. The physical model must enforce UNIQUE(source_id,
  revision_no), valid_to > valid_from when present, and append-only permissions.
end note

