note as IMMUTABLE_diagram_10c_external_ecosystem_audit
  All tables in this diagram are append-only. They are partitioned by time,
  protected from UPDATE/DELETE by runtime roles and retained according to the
  stricter of legal, contractual, security and litigation-hold requirements.
end note

note as HISTORY_CONTRACT_diagram_10c_external_ecosystem_audit
  UNIFORM HISTORY CONTRACT
  Each history table uses a singular source FK, revision_no, valid_from/valid_to,
  data_snapshot and recorded_at. The physical model must enforce UNIQUE(source_id,
  revision_no), valid_to > valid_from when present, and append-only permissions.
end note

