note as DEP_diagram_10h_ecosystem_extension_histories
  Connects to other modules via the base tables in modules 42B/43C/43D/19B/19C/47/48/49/50/51
  (source schemas) and terminology.catalog_concepts (operation/change_reason). data_snapshot
  holds the full prior row image as jsonb.
end note
note as HARDENING_diagram_10h_ecosystem_extension_histories
  REC 3.4 — history rows are append-only; UNIQUE(<base>_id, row_version); index (<base>_id,
  valid_from DESC). Populate via AFTER UPDATE/DELETE triggers on the source tables. A CI check
  must assert entity_registry.has_history=true <=> a matching audit.*_history exists.
end note


